For your project, an object-style representation would look conceptually like:

```text
+----------------------+
| Student : student1   |
+----------------------+
| studentId = S101     |
| name = Geetanshi     |
| email = abc@gmail.com|
+----------------------+
          |
          | submits
          ↓
+----------------------+
